{"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[27],"Id":56,"TextResource":{"Name":"gundert","Translations":[{"Text":"Gundert","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Gundert","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":90}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Más de 40 años de experiencia han forjado a esta joyería especialista en lapislázuli. Artesanía fina y accesorios confeccionados en esta preciada y tradicional piedra del norte de Chile, para que lleve una parte de nuestro país a cualquier lugar del mundo.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>More than 40 years' experience has built this jewelers who specialize in lapis lazuli. Gundert offers you fine handicrafts and accessories made with this valued traditional stone from the north of Chile, so that you take with you a fragment of this country to any place in the world.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/056_gundert.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/jewelry\/gundert","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/joyeria\/gundert","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/056_gundert.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/56\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/056_gundert.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/56\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true}